[[starting-the-broker]]
=== Starting the broker

Then, we need an AMQP broker. In this case we will use an Apache ActiveMQ Artemis server.
You can follow the instructions from the https://activemq.apache.org/components/artemis/[Apache Artemis website] or start a broker via docker using the https://github.com/artemiscloud/activemq-artemis-broker-image[ArtemisCloud] container image:

[source,bash,subs=attributes+]
----
