[[oidc-client-ref-integration-testing-wiremock]]
==== Wiremock

. Add the following dependencies to your test project:
+
[source,xml]
----
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.wiremock</groupId>
    <artifactId>wiremock</artifactId>
